  "body": "## What\n\nPropose an `agentd` monitor with a durable webhook inbox, pure state reduction, registry projection and confirmed bus notifications. Specify head-bound relay waits, coordinator streaming, REST repair, and operator setup. Add proposed decision 0007 and small dependent work items for the coordinator to file.\n\n## Why\n\nIssue #98 reports exhaustion of the shared user GraphQL budget while seven workers were active. Central reads and a monitor-specific App installation reduce duplicate requests and separate the monitor's primary budget. The immediate stopgap uses one coordinator-owned REST/ETag collector with existing tools.\n\n## Evidence\n\nHarness: Codex CLI 0.157.1. Model: `gpt-6-astra` at medium.\n\n- [Research notes](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/docs/98-github-event-monitor-design/research/gates/github-events/notes.md) and [source versions and checkout paths](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/blob/docs/98-github-event-monitor-design/research/gates/github-events/versions.md).\n- [Raw issue, PR review and REST evidence](https://github.com/tbhb/agent-orchestration-poc/tree/docs/98-github-event-monitor-design/research/gates/github-events/evidence), including the attributed incident report and a conditional request returning HTTP 304 with `gh` exit 1.\n- `mise run fmt`, `mise run check` and `mise run check:mermaid` passed. Nine Mermaid blocks parsed with zero invalid blocks. Direct gitleaks scan of the research directory found no leaks.\n- Local `docs:check-links` could not launch Chromium because the sandbox denied its Mach bootstrap registration. The PR docs job passed and validated the site build and links. No host or sandbox setting was changed.\n- Live webhook delivery, App approval counting, secret isolation and the complete harness wake/reachability matrix remain untested. The proposal preserves the #96 relay boundary and does not promise automatic Codex wake.\n\n## Docs\n\nAdd the design page, proposed decision and index entries. Record exact App permissions, events, file paths, Funnel commands and rollback as operator actions. This PR changes documents and evidence only.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] CI is green: check, docs, pr-body, imported-research and mutation.\n- [x] Docs are updated.\n- [x] No secrets are included.\n- [x] Evidence is committed.\n\nRefs: #98\n\n",
